Declarative extension cards, native forms, mail compose, read-only mail parsing,
source-preserving HTML edits and preview theme adaptation are also adapted from
Cindy v0.1.112 (8bd60e8549cdcf0ada21e6f73d68dc0d0b71909d), copyright 2026
Cindy contributors, under Apache-2.0. Sources include cindy-brain/cardService.ts,
