The declaration parsing, destination matching, request and credential injection,
redirect validation, bounded text reads and token exchange are adapted from
apps/desktop/src/shared/ghost.ts and main/cindy-brain/networkSlot.ts at the same
fixed release. Host credential setup and outbound proxy integration are Joko's.
Media MIME validation is adapted from main/cindy-media/sniffMediaMime.ts and
the exact media type mapping from main/cindy-media/blobStore.ts at that release.

Directory upload receipts, bounded multipart assembly, save-directory receipts,
safe non-overwriting filenames and downloaded file responses are adapted from
main/cindy-brain/dirDeposit.ts and networkSlot.ts at the same fixed release.
Joko adaptations bind each in-memory receipt to the approved installation,
task occurrence, current workspace registration and authorization generation.

Host-assessed OAuth setup cards and their original-controller authorization
context are adapted from main/plugin-oauth/cards.ts, context.ts and
transactions.ts and main/cindy-brain/ghostSetupCoordinator.ts at that release.
Joko uses its existing authenticated Connection, private callback input and
service-owned task queue to preserve that boundary without exposing controller
offers, callback codes or tokens to an extension's HTML or runtime.
